  "note": "[H] uses (12.8) only in the proof of Prop 12.2.4, where with (12.11) it bounds err_{q,R} from above; this gives (12.27)–(12.28), an upper bound on sq, and the constant c_{ρ,2}. Erratum: The book cites (12.8) G(R) <= log R + 1.4709 to [Ram95, Lemma 3.4], the same lemma it cites for the asymptotic (12.12); (12.12) gives (12.8) only for R >= 146041, so the bound is Ramare's Lemma 3.5(1) (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_12_8.py`)."
